                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Terrible Texas Hold'em Game\n\nI bought this game to unwind and because of the artwork of the female characters (you don't get adult content by beating the characters, in case anyone was thinking of buying the game for that reason). It's one of my favorite poker games, Texas Hold'em, but honestly, it's a terrible game. It's lifeless and lacks the excitement of other games of this style on Steam. The interface, music, and overall design are very disappointing. The game's programming for the rounds doesn't add any excitement, unlike playing with friends or other games on Steam. Honestly, I'd recommend buying \"Poker Night at the Inventory,\" which is more entertaining and of higher quality than this game.\n\nIn my opinion, it's not worth buying, not even on sale or if it's free.\n\n2/10",
